- [Svelte SDK](https://docs.getunleash.io/sdks/svelte.md): Set up the Unleash Svelte SDK to evaluate feature flags in Svelte apps with context, variants, rendering control, and Edge.
- [Vue SDK](https://docs.getunleash.io/sdks/vue.md): Set up the Unleash Vue SDK to evaluate feature flags in Vue.js apps with context updates, variants, deferred start, and toolbar support.
- [Node.js OpenFeature provider](https://docs.getunleash.io/sdks/openfeature/node.md): Set up the Unleash OpenFeature provider for Node.js to evaluate feature flags through the OpenFeature API.
- [PHP OpenFeature provider](https://docs.getunleash.io/sdks/openfeature/php.md): Set up the Unleash OpenFeature provider for PHP to evaluate feature flags through the OpenFeature API.
